The [Molecule](https://docs.ansible.com/projects/molecule/) `default` scenario
runs this collection's modules on the control node against your API endpoint. It
creates, changes and removes only records prefixed `molecule_fixture_`. You
supply the endpoint, automation account and recovery; the scenario provisions
nothing.

Paths are relative to this directory unless stated otherwise.


